  "description": "Peel for League of Legends Heroes' match AI: when an enemy champion gets on top of the team's ADC, the support (and the top laner or jungler standing near the ADC) turns on that champion instead of whatever the game's AI had them hitting - basic attacks, forward moves and champion-targeted skills aimed at another enemy go to the diver; retreats, recalls and skills on allies are left alone. No random numbers, so the server's presim and the replay match. league_peel.log records what the game's AI wanted each guard to do when a dive started, with a summary every 500 dives that also goes to league_peel.sum.log.\n\n保护射手：对面英雄贴到我方射手身边时，辅助（以及离射手近的上单、打野）转去打这个人，不再打游戏 AI 原本让他打的目标——普攻、往前走、对着别的敌方英雄放的指向技能都改成对贴脸的人；撤退、回城、给队友的技能不动。没有随机数，服务器预演和重演一致。league_peel.log 记下每次射手被贴脸时游戏 AI 原本让保镖做什么，每 500 次一行汇总，也追加到 league_peel.sum.log。",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-08",
  "mod_id": "league_peel",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: peel the ADC (match AI)",
  "version": "0.2.3"
}